{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-07-22T15:44:10.743889Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"79321b12-8c05-403f-afe7-97f87f50b4c2","title":"Upstream candidate: migrate hub-v3 builds genesis from stale local v2 cache - should fetch immediately before genesis cut (mdatron cutover evidence in #19)","description":"Evidence from the real mdatron cutover 2026-07-22: pre-flight fetch 08:07, agent wrote v2 at 08:18-08:20 (before swap), migrate at 08:32 cut genesis from the 08:07 cache state missing those events; AC-6 finalize guard caught it. Fix: the migrate dispatcher should fetch the v2 hub right before build_genesis_from_files. Not yet filed upstream.","priority":"medium","created_by":"anon-8ea7a055"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-07-22T15:44:16.754728Z","event":{"type":"LabelAdded","issue_uuid":"79321b12-8c05-403f-afe7-97f87f50b4c2","label":"upstream"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-07-26T00:07:38.444666Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"79321b12-8c05-403f-afe7-97f87f50b4c2","comment_uuid":"bf78c2b6-140b-440b-9ce6-6ef29ad3766e","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"DIAGNOSIS CORRECTED by code trace before filing. The original stale-genesis premise is WRONG: SyncManager::fetch on a v2 hub routes to fetch_v2_readonly (sync/cache.rs:298-320) which fetches AND resets the cache worktree to the remote tip, and the migrate dispatcher calls it (migrate_hub_v3.rs:87) before build_genesis_from_files - mdatron's 08:32 genesis therefore INCLUDED 79Ig's 08:18-08:20 work (backup pre-counts at ~08:21 already showed 76/204, and remigrate re-derived the identical 76/204 genesis). The finalize refusal was caused by MY three post-migration lock releases: verify_against_files (migrate_hub_v3.rs:1118) requires reduce(all v3 refs) == genesis (check 2), an invariant only valid at migration time; at finalize (called at :1479 with a same-moment rebuilt genesis, making the v2-freshness check vacuous) ANY legitimate v3 event permanently blocks finalize. Real defect: finalize reuses the migration-time invariant; soak-then-finalize as documented is impossible. Fix shape: at finalize verify v2 files still reproduce the stored/watermarked genesis AND reduce(refs up to the seeded watermark) == genesis, instead of reduce(everything) == genesis.","created_at":"2026-07-26T00:07:38.444646Z","kind":"observation"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":8,"timestamp":"2026-07-26T00:08:26.998790Z","event":{"type":"IssueUpdated","uuid":"79321b12-8c05-403f-afe7-97f87f50b4c2","title":"gh#45: finalize AC-6 gate reuses migration-time invariant - refuses after any legitimate post-migration v3 activity"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":9,"timestamp":"2026-07-26T00:08:32.516594Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"79321b12-8c05-403f-afe7-97f87f50b4c2","comment_uuid":"f5cab806-e4ff-444b-9f64-ccf9d8a7e89a","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Filed upstream as dollspace-gay/crosslink#45 with the corrected diagnosis, the mdatron refusal + two clean control cases as evidence, the code trace (verify_against_files migrate_hub_v3.rs:1118, vacuous check 1 at the :1479 call site, fetch_v2_readonly ruling out staleness), proposed fix (persist genesis in HubMeta; verify v2-frozen + watermark-prefix instead of reduce==genesis), and workaround (finalize immediately; remigrate if blocked).","created_at":"2026-07-26T00:08:32.516575Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":10,"timestamp":"2026-07-26T00:08:38.204739Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"79321b12-8c05-403f-afe7-97f87f50b4c2","comment_uuid":"d0d608a2-c8d3-4c2c-801a-b38cd74d1406","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"gh#45 filed (finalize guard defect - corrected from the stale-genesis hypothesis via code trace; local #21 retitled and documented). Remaining open threads: local #4 dashboard v3-awareness (gh#4 remnant - three real v3 repos now surface as unreachable, natural next fix cycle), epic #3 open pending gh#4 disposition. Fleet steady on 0.9 v3 hubs.","created_at":"2026-07-26T00:08:38.204718Z","kind":"handoff"}}
