{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":84,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T18:51:56.528813Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"16e822ba-fdb8-4a01-b683-89efdba88526","comment_uuid":"fac2fe28-388d-4098-a550-9faf10e620ad","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"PR#54 verified MERGED (2026-08-01, 6b4f736f). LOCAL synced: develop d77a37ba->6b4f736f (==upstream, incl gh#48/49/53), main 85691369->26ee1885 (==upstream; advanced 34 commits - mostly dependabot bumps + PR#44 kickoff-template feature, no release cut). Note: develop tracks origin/develop (the fork) so bare pull hit the fork; used 'git pull --ff-only upstream develop' explicitly. FORK (origin) still behind on BOTH: origin/develop d77a37ba, origin/main 85691369 - both need operator pushes. dashboard-v3-monitoring worktree removed (PR#54 merged). Binary rebuilding from 6b4f736f (prior d77a37ba preserved). Closeout: gh#48/#53 close on dollspace's develop->main sync (Fixes-keyword only fires on main merge).","created_at":"2026-08-01T18:51:56.528789Z","kind":"result"}}
